OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GThe BBC Singers perform a
OL,6,     Gprogramme of festive vocal music
OL,7,     Glive from Temple Church, London
OL,8,     Gand Mark Forrest introduces music
OL,9,     Gfrom Belfast International Arts
OL,10,     GFestival.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,12,     GKate Molleson traces Prokofiev's
OL,13,     Greturn to Russia as he falls for
OL,14,     GRomeo and Juliet.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,17,     Gmusic from folk duo Honey and the
OL,18,     GBear, who are joined in the
OL,19,     Gstudio by Kyson Point. Petroc
OL,20,     Galso speaks to composer Asaf
OL,21,     GZohar about Ballet Shoes.
